blurb = "Depicts the opening ceremony of Hisamatsuza, a prominent kabuki theater in Tōkyō.

The text labels show the name of each of the depicted actors.

The theater burned down and was rebuilt multiple times, eventually reopening as the Meijiza theater, still operating today."
